    "Thanks for opening this page >< I hope you enjoy my work! Wishing you happiness and success every day!": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thanks for opening this page >< I hope you enjoy my work! Wishing you happiness and success every day!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "感谢你愿意打开此页面><希望你喜欢我的创作！祝你天天开心，一切顺利！"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merci d’avoir ouvert cette page >< J’espère que mes créations vous plairont ! Je vous souhaite du bonheur et que tout se passe bien chaque jour !"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Danke, dass du diese Seite geöffnet hast >< Ich hoffe, dir gefallen meine Werke! Ich wünsche dir jeden Tag Freude und dass alles gut läuft!"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grazie per aver aperto questa pagina >< Spero che ti piacciano le mie creazioni! Ti auguro felicità e che tutto vada bene ogni giorno!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    " is a clipboard app based on ": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
