    "Copy and paste require an explicit click. Full preview and editing stay disabled. Local reveal works only in manual privacy; automatic protection stays masked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy and paste require an explicit click. Full preview and editing stay disabled. Local reveal works only in manual privacy; automatic protection stays masked."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La copie et le collage nécessitent un clic explicite. L’aperçu complet et l’édition restent désactivés. La révélation locale fonctionne uniquement en protection manuelle ; la protection automatique reste masquée."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopieren und Einfügen erfordern einen bewussten Klick. Vollständige Vorschau und Bearbeitung bleiben deaktiviert. Lokales Einblenden funktioniert nur im manuellen Datenschutzmodus; automatischer Schutz bleibt verdeckt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copia e incolla richiedono un clic esplicito. Anteprima completa e modifica restano disabilitate. La visualizzazione locale funziona solo nella privacy manuale; la protezione automatica resta oscurata."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
