    "The note stays visible. Copy and paste use the original; previews, editing, dragging and online link previews are blocked while hidden.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The note stays visible. Copy and paste use the original; previews, editing, dragging and online link previews are blocked while hidden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备注仍会显示。复制、粘贴使用原内容；隐藏时禁用完整预览、编辑、拖拽及在线链接预览。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La note reste visible. Copier et coller utilisent l’original ; les aperçus, l’édition, le glissement et les aperçus de liens en ligne sont bloqués lorsque le contenu est masqué."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Notiz bleibt sichtbar. Kopieren und Einfügen nutzen das Original; Vorschau, Bearbeiten, Ziehen und Online-Linkvorschau sind bei ausgeblendetem Inhalt gesperrt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nota resta visibile. Copia e incolla usano l’originale; anteprime, modifica, trascinamento e anteprime dei link online sono bloccati quando il contenuto è nascosto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the pinned-items shortcut or menu item. In the clipboard panel it selects Pinned; a separate window only shows pinned items.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use the pinned-items shortcut or menu item. In the clipboard panel it selects Pinned; a separate window only shows pinned items."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用置顶专用快捷键或菜单入口。聚合模式会自动筛选置顶；单窗口只显示置顶项目。"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Utilisez le raccourci ou le menu des éléments épinglés. Le panneau sélectionne Épinglés ; une fenêtre séparée ne montre que ces éléments."
